---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectHero from '../../components/features/projects/ProjectHero.astro';
import AchievementCard from '../../components/common/AchievementCard.astro';
import ProjectDetailSection from '../../components/features/projects/ProjectDetailSection.astro';
import ProjectTags from '../../components/features/projects/ProjectTags.astro';

const title = 'Bank Projections and Financial Modeling';
const description = 'Developed detailed financial models and projections to secure multiple loans—including $2M, $10M, PPP, and disaster relief—supporting facility expansion and operational resilience.';
const date = new Date('2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z');
const tags = ['Financial Modeling', 'Bank Projections', 'Commercial Real Estate', 'Loan', 'Financial Analysis'];
const image = '/assets/projects/bank-projections.png';
const canonicalUrl = 'https://blakeoxford.com/projects/bank-projections-modeling/';
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  image={image}
  url={canonicalUrl}
  wide={true}
>
  <ProjectHero
    title={title}
    description={description}
    date={date}
    image={image}
  />

  <article class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-subtle via-background to-background py-24">
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-grid-overlay/35 [background-size:200px_200px]"
      aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>
    <div class="layout-shell-wide relative flex flex-col gap-14">
      <ProjectDetailSection title="Background" eyebrow="Context">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
          <p>
            From 2018 through 2022, I led financial modeling and projection efforts for several critical funding initiatives:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span><strong>2018:</strong> Secured a $2M loan to renovate 30,000 sq. ft (18K billable, 12K warehouse) of existing space.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span><strong>2020:</strong> Obtained PPP funding and a Disaster Relief Loan to sustain operations during COVID-19 disruptions.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span><strong>2022:</strong> Built comprehensive models for a $10M loan to construct a 36,000 sq. ft autism center.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            The objective: present lenders with clear, data-driven insight into revenue potential, expense structures, and cash-flow viability across varied market conditions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </ProjectDetailSection>

      <ProjectDetailSection title="Key Achievements" eyebrow="Highlights" layout="surface">
        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-1">
          <AchievementCard
            title="Comprehensive Scenario Analysis"
            achievements={[
              'Built dynamic Excel models incorporating best-case, base-case, and worst-case assumptions, enabling stakeholders to understand risks and opportunities.'
            ]}
          />

          <AchievementCard
            title="Multi-Loan Experience"
            achievements={[
              'Tailored projections for differing project scales—from renovation financing to large-scale facility construction and pandemic relief funding requirements.'
            ]}
          />

          <AchievementCard
            title="Sensitivity &amp; Stress Testing"
            achievements={[
              'Integrated sensitivity tables and stress tests for key variables (occupancy rates, reimbursement changes, operating costs) to demonstrate model robustness.'
            ]}
          />

          <AchievementCard
            title="Lender-Aligned Reporting"
            achievements={[
              'Crafted bank-friendly projection reports aligned with underwriting standards and supporting documentation (monthly P&L, cash-flow statements, balance-sheet forecasts).'
            ]}
          />

          <AchievementCard
            title="Strategic Narrative Development"
            achievements={[
              'Paired quantitative models with executive summaries—framing the financial story to match lender priorities.'
            ]}
          />
        </div>
      </ProjectDetailSection>

      <ProjectDetailSection title="Impact" eyebrow="Outcomes">
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface/95 p-8 ring-1 ring-border/25 shadow-card dark:bg-surface-dark/95">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">$2M Renovation Loan (2018)</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
                Enabled critical facility upgrades, increasing billable space and operational efficiency.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface/95 p-8 ring-1 ring-border/25 shadow-card dark:bg-surface-dark/95">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">PPP &amp; Disaster Relief (2020)</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
                Secured lifeline funding that preserved jobs and stabilized cash flow during unprecedented downturns.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface/95 p-8 ring-1 ring-border/25 shadow-card dark:bg-surface-dark/95">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">$10M Center Loan (2022)</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
                Provided capital for a state-of-the-art autism care facility, supporting long-term growth and community impact.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
            These wins showcased financial feasibility and established a reusable template for future funding rounds and strategic planning.
          </p>
        </div>
      </ProjectDetailSection>

      <ProjectDetailSection title="Lessons &amp; Takeaways" eyebrow="What stuck" layout="surface">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Adapt to scale.</h3>
            <p>Financial models must flex to project size—renovation, new build, and emergency relief all demand unique assumptions and storytelling.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Align with lenders.</h3>
            <p>Understanding bank underwriting criteria upfront streamlines approvals and reduces revision cycles.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Numbers need narrative.</h3>
            <p>A compelling executive summary can be as persuasive as the spreadsheets themselves.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Build reusable frameworks.</h3>
            <p>Templates and standardized models accelerate future funding efforts and ensure consistency.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Make it operations-driven.</h3>
            <p>
              Accuracy skyrocketed when projections tied to operational realities. By collaborating with department heads, I mapped key drivers—revenue per client, staffing ratios, overhead—enabling dynamic scenario planning. By 2025, robust data systems let us adjust variables (client volume, staffing, reimbursement rates) and immediately see forward-looking profitability, shifting conversations from "Can we afford this?" to "Where should we invest for maximum impact?"
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </ProjectDetailSection>

      <ProjectDetailSection title="Reflection" eyebrow="Personal note">
        <p class="text-base italic leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
          By evolving from surface-level forecasts to operations-driven projections with real-time variable manipulation, financial modeling became a strategic dialogue—giving leaders clarity, confidence, and actionable insight.
        </p>
      </ProjectDetailSection>
    </div>
  </article>

  <ProjectTags tags={tags} />
</Layout>
